# BD2 · S13 · Paso 4: configuración y backup incremental de nivel 0 (base de todos los incrementales).
SHOW ALL;
CONFIGURE CONTROLFILE AUTOBACKUP ON;
CONFIGURE RETENTION POLICY TO RECOVERY WINDOW OF 7 DAYS;
CONFIGURE BACKUP OPTIMIZATION ON;
BACKUP INCREMENTAL LEVEL 0 DATABASE PLUS ARCHIVELOG TAG 'S13_NIVEL0';
LIST BACKUP SUMMARY;
REPORT SCHEMA;
